Z||000000||mshill||10-21-1999||01:24 PM||||I cut my old catalytic converter out of my exhaust system last night in order to put the new one on.  The old cat was 18 inches long and when I got it off there was nothing in side it but a chunk of catalyst the size of<BR>my fist (talk about a free flowing cat).<P>The new one is about 9 inches long and went on with two pipes (one on either end of the cat) and four clamps.  Seems like a lot of clamps and chance for a leak, but thats what I got in the kit from Mirmont (sp?).<P>I will be hanging the exhaust tonight and heading back to the Smog Check station for my free retest tomorrow.<BR>||||reg||10
